name: ['Betrayal of Flesh', 'Carrion Rats', 'Chittering Rats', 'Crippling Fatigue', 'Crypt Rats', 'Diabolic Tutor', 'Dirge of Dread', 'Dirty Wererat', 'Gravestorm', 'Infernal Contract', 'Larceny', 'Marrow-Gnawer', 'Nezumi Bone-Reader', 'Nezumi Cutthroat', 'Nezumi Graverobber // Nighteyes the Desecrator', 'Nocturnal Raid', 'Patron of the Nezumi', "Rats' Feast", 'Sever Soul', 'Skullsnatcher', 'Suppress', 'Swamp', 'Swarm of Rats']
